1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
The Clover Kingdom.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,000
In this place where magic is everything,

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
there lives one boy who was born without it.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
His name is Asta.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
His strength and determination helped him become a magic knight.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
And despite the many challenges he faces,

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
he aims for the top and refuses to give up.

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Rich or poor, royalty or commoner,

9
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Asta believes anyone can shine.

10
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,000
His mission is to prove that to the whole world,

11
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,000
and to become the next Wizard King.

12
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Even the parts of the Forsaken Realm

13
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
that were hardest hit by the enemy have begun to recover.

14
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Things are finally looking brighter for the kingdom as a whole.

15
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Yes, and to make this an everlasting peace rather than a fleeting one,

16
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000
we all need to remain strong whatever comes our way.

17
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Hope you're ready to work, sir.

18
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:01,000
We've got the captain's meeting as well as the decoration ceremony.

