61
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,320
Our topic for today

62
00:02:45,320 --> 00:02:47,320
Is who will participate in the Heart Kingdom's training?

63
00:02:47,320 --> 00:02:49,320
The battle against the Spade Kingdom, which we promised Queen Lora Petyka we'd help with, is drawing near now

64
00:02:49,320 --> 00:02:53,600
Of course, I know that you've all been making great strides on your own.

65
00:02:54,140 --> 00:02:58,300
But we've just received word that they've completed preparations for their training regimen as well.

66
00:02:58,620 --> 00:02:59,960
We've reached the final step.

67
00:03:00,900 --> 00:03:03,460
There are five Spirit Guardians who will be working with us.

68
00:03:04,380 --> 00:03:06,780
Each of them can only take a certain number of trainees.

69
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:12,360
As such, I'd like you all to tell me which subordinates you'll be nominating from each of your squads.

70
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:15,620
Now then, which of the Magic Knights are we sending?

71
00:03:15,620 --> 00:03:23,040
Obviously, I pick Asta and Nero, especially since the Heart Kingdom already told us they wanted them.

72
00:03:23,920 --> 00:03:27,520
Asta uses Anti-Magic, and Nero wields Forbidden Magic.

73
00:03:28,100 --> 00:03:30,440
Not only that, but they're both at the Arcane Stage.

74
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:35,200
We know from experience that their unique abilities will be a tremendous asset in this fight.

75
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:40,340
And through further training, I'm sure they'll find ways to amplify their strengths even more.

76
00:03:40,980 --> 00:03:42,640
They'll send Finral and Luck, too.

77
00:03:43,060 --> 00:03:44,680
Oh, and Noelle, definitely.

78
00:03:45,620 --> 00:03:48,800
Oh, what's wrong? Are you worried about her?

79
00:03:49,160 --> 00:03:51,620
That's so sweet, you're such a protective big brother.

80
00:03:52,420 --> 00:03:56,680
I feel like she and Luck would be a good complement to the others on account of their magic types.

81
00:03:57,440 --> 00:04:03,200
Interestingly, one of the Spirit Guardians uses Lightning Spells, and the Queen has the Water Spirit known as Undine.

82
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:07,580
When you consider all of those factors, I believe your assessment is right on the money.

83
00:04:07,580 --> 00:04:11,860
Besides, Luck's itching to go so badly, he can't stand it.

84
00:04:12,260 --> 00:04:15,580
And it seems like Noelle's more motivated now than she's ever been.

85
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:20,040
That makes sense. Magicula is the devil who killed their mother, after all.

86
00:04:20,460 --> 00:04:21,580
And as for Finral...

87
00:04:21,580 --> 00:04:23,860
Well, he's just handy.

88
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:29,540
We can't underestimate the importance of support mages like him, especially if he improves his skill even more.

89
00:04:30,180 --> 00:04:32,220
Perhaps he'll open up some new strategies for us.

90
00:04:33,100 --> 00:04:34,720
Oh yeah, that's what I was gonna say.

91
00:04:35,260 --> 00:04:37,300
From the Black Bulls, we have five mages.

92
00:04:37,460 --> 00:04:42,620
Asta, Narrow, Luck Voltia, Noelle Silva, and the spatial mage called Finral.

93
00:04:42,620 --> 00:04:44,900
Well, that's more than I expected.

94
00:04:45,540 --> 00:04:47,480
That's cause I've got plenty of good people.

95
00:04:48,020 --> 00:04:49,540
Should be a fairly strong lineup.

96
00:04:50,160 --> 00:04:54,240
As for the Golden Dawn's nomination, I submit Mimosa for Million.

97
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:56,560
We are fighting a devil.

98
00:04:57,300 --> 00:04:59,860
So I'm certain the conflict ahead will be brutal.

99
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:04,120
We can't hope to succeed without recovery mages.

100
00:05:05,400 --> 00:05:08,760
Because she's a royal, she was born with great talent.

101
00:05:08,760 --> 00:05:13,340
If we can help her to reach her full potential, then that bodes well for us.

102
00:05:13,840 --> 00:05:14,740
A wise choice.

103
00:05:15,100 --> 00:05:16,680
But is she your only nomination?

104
00:05:17,260 --> 00:05:20,320
I hear the Wind Spirit Guardian is going to be involved, after all.

105
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:22,640
Actually, you know has declined.

106
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:25,260
Knowing him, I assume he had his reasons.

107
00:05:25,820 --> 00:05:26,040
Hmm.

108
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:29,840
And who are the candidates from all the other squads?

109
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:33,960
From the Crimson Lion Kings, we have chosen Leopold Vermillion.

110
00:05:35,140 --> 00:05:37,080
Leo's ambition is extremely high.

111
00:05:37,080 --> 00:05:42,700
In fact, he asked our sister, Mera Leona, to help him train at the Volcano in the strong magic region.

112
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:45,700
Just thinking about that makes me tired.

113
00:05:46,100 --> 00:05:49,020
No one in my squad can match Leo's passion and work ethic.

114
00:05:49,420 --> 00:05:50,660
But he's still hesitant.

115
00:05:51,660 --> 00:05:56,280
I'm hoping that this opportunity will ignite a flame within his heart that burns away that hesitation.

116
00:05:57,300 --> 00:06:02,700
If he can overcome that, then not only will he be a powerful force in our battle against Spade,

117
00:06:02,980 --> 00:06:06,500
but he can guard this kingdom with all the strength and pride of a great lion!

118
00:06:06,500 --> 00:06:10,800
Excellent. I look forward to seeing how much Leo progresses, then.

119
00:06:11,320 --> 00:06:13,060
What about the other squads?

120
00:06:15,020 --> 00:06:18,040
Is there anyone you wish to nominate from the Blue Rose Knights?

121
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:21,980
First, sire, I would like you to clarify something for me.

122
00:06:22,380 --> 00:06:25,080
Is it possible for one of the captains to nominate themselves?

123
00:06:25,620 --> 00:06:26,700
Sure, that's alright.

124
00:06:26,700 --> 00:06:33,520
Since you were possessed by an elf in the last conflict, I believe subjecting you to this training could provide some interesting results.

125
00:06:33,520 --> 00:06:40,720
I still remember how it felt to have that elf spirit's power coursing through me.

126
00:06:41,700 --> 00:06:44,460
Her red rose mana was far superior to my own.

127
00:06:45,980 --> 00:06:49,620
It doesn't matter how I increase my strength, I just know that I must.

128
00:06:50,380 --> 00:06:53,420
I'll do whatever it takes to experience that again.

129
00:06:53,420 --> 00:06:58,100
And by experience, I meant the magic. Nothing more.

130
00:06:58,600 --> 00:07:02,880
Then the only nominee from the Blue Rose Knights is Captain Charlotte herself, is that correct?

131
00:07:03,580 --> 00:07:03,980
Yes.

132
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:05,660
Any other captains?

133
00:07:06,380 --> 00:07:11,500
It troubles me to admit it, but I believe that younger candidates would be best.

134
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:15,560
I agree. And I'm quite capable of conducting my training on my own.

135
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:19,920
I'd be glad to go if it means I get to slash the Heart Kingdom open, ke-ke.

136
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:21,440
Yeah, you're not going.

137
00:07:21,440 --> 00:07:28,420
I imagine this regimen will be grueling, but they'll discover and learn so much that they never would have been able to here in Clover.

138
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:33,000
They'll be in a brand new world. I expect them to take full advantage of that.

139
00:07:34,280 --> 00:07:36,600
Discovering a new world?

140
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:40,440
My appetite's insatiable!

141
00:07:42,260 --> 00:07:45,680
Keep being vigilant and training with your magic every day.

142
00:07:46,320 --> 00:07:49,860
That would take protein.

143
00:07:49,860 --> 00:07:52,980
Eat this! That's for the protein!

144
00:07:53,100 --> 00:07:57,080
Each one of you has amazing potential. I'd like to see it grow even more.

145
00:07:57,440 --> 00:07:57,880
Growing.

146
00:07:58,840 --> 00:07:59,280
Yeah.

147
00:07:59,640 --> 00:08:02,220
And this! That one's for the fat!

148
00:08:02,220 --> 00:08:08,100
This is for the vitamins! This is for the fiber! This is for the collagen!

149
00:08:10,320 --> 00:08:12,200
Me! Me! Me! Me! Me!

150
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:15,520
Oh my! Someone's full of energy!

151
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:18,180
Yeah, where the heck did that come from?

152
00:08:18,320 --> 00:08:21,440
The only person I want to nominate from the Aqua Deer is me!

153
00:08:21,440 --> 00:08:26,840
If I get stronger, then maybe that nice, beautiful lady will notice me.

154
00:08:27,580 --> 00:08:30,320
We've probably selected enough candidates at this point.

155
00:08:31,060 --> 00:08:32,220
But are there any others?

156
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:40,020
I don't have anyone from the Silver Eagles, but I assure you we'll train to the best of our ability and be ready for the fight against the Spade Kingdom.

157
00:08:40,400 --> 00:08:41,280
As will we.

158
00:08:41,660 --> 00:08:43,580
And we're going to handle things our way!

159
00:08:43,760 --> 00:08:47,880
Well then, do we all agree on the candidates who were proposed?

160
00:08:48,340 --> 00:08:48,980
As proved!

161
00:08:50,040 --> 00:08:50,460
Lovely.

162
00:08:50,460 --> 00:08:53,260
Lovely. I'm expecting great things from this group.

163
00:08:53,760 --> 00:08:54,100
Sir!

164
00:08:54,740 --> 00:08:58,260
Very well then. Today's captain's meeting is officially adjourned.

165
00:08:59,040 --> 00:09:03,160
Good. That's finally over. See ya.

166
00:09:05,860 --> 00:09:08,140
And just where do you think you're going?

167
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:11,300
The decoration ceremony is about to start.

168
00:09:11,900 --> 00:09:14,160
Ugh. Do I really have to go to that?

169
00:09:14,840 --> 00:09:16,740
But I got my wheels parked out front.

170
00:09:17,940 --> 00:09:19,580
And my squad never gets picked.

171
00:09:19,580 --> 00:09:23,460
We were told that all nine captains are required to be in attendance.

172
00:09:23,980 --> 00:09:25,320
What? Why?

173
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:31,920
Well, you see, apparently the king himself is going to participate this time.

174
00:09:31,920 --> 00:09:33,560
You're kidding me.

175
00:09:33,560 --> 00:09:50,520
The captain's from every squad in one room. It's an all-star lineup.

176
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:55,260
I see they've required all the captains to attend since they knew I'd be making an appearance.

177
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:56,980
Exactly as it should be.

178
00:09:57,980 --> 00:10:02,080
Up till now, the king's only seen me at a distance. He's bound to figure it out.

179
00:10:03,120 --> 00:10:03,860
Captain Jack?

180
00:10:03,860 --> 00:10:12,880
Will you let me come back to the squad?

181
00:10:13,880 --> 00:10:14,840
What's with him?

182
00:10:15,340 --> 00:10:16,520
Guess he needs me.

183
00:10:17,380 --> 00:10:18,540
The slice into pieces!

184
00:10:18,540 --> 00:10:22,360
I believe everyone is present now.

185
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:24,440
Then I say we start!

186
00:10:25,380 --> 00:10:25,540
Hmm.

187
00:10:25,540 --> 00:10:27,680
Attention all!

188
00:10:27,680 --> 00:10:34,480
This is a special decoration ceremony for the Magic Knights who bravely fought against the Eye of the Midnight Sun.

189
00:10:35,820 --> 00:10:40,280
The Wizard King is still unable to use his voice, so I'll be conducting this myself.

190
00:10:40,880 --> 00:10:41,540
Without further ado...

191
00:10:41,540 --> 00:10:49,800
For ado, Sol Merrin of the Blue Rose Knights with 21 stars. As of today, you'll be a 5th-class senior Magic Knight.

192
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:55,760
With your calm, quick thinking, you were able to transport the injured Wizard King to safety.

193
00:10:56,620 --> 00:10:59,660
Please continue to exercise that wise judgment on the battlefield.

194
00:11:01,420 --> 00:11:05,080
My, my. That young lady moved up three ranks at once.

195
00:11:05,380 --> 00:11:10,600
She did save the Wizard King's life, so I'd say she's more than deserving of such a promotion.

196
00:11:11,540 --> 00:11:14,180
To be honest, I wasn't calm at all.

197
00:11:14,520 --> 00:11:18,380
Not to mention, Char had to be rescued by the Captain of the Black Bulls of all people.

198
00:11:19,940 --> 00:11:23,560
Next time, I'll protect her without the help of some dumb, disgusting man!

199
00:11:23,900 --> 00:11:24,160
Hmm?

200
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:26,100
Heads up.

201
00:11:26,640 --> 00:11:29,560
Your subordinate's staring me down on something serious.

202
00:11:30,060 --> 00:11:30,940
Is that so?

203
00:11:31,640 --> 00:11:33,040
She's staring at Yami?

204
00:11:33,940 --> 00:11:37,880
Oh no! Please, Sol! Don't tell me you like him as well!

205
00:11:38,640 --> 00:11:38,960
Huh?

206
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:41,980
Wow, she looks so passionate!

207
00:11:42,300 --> 00:11:44,620
Don't worry, Char, I won't let you down!

208
00:11:45,680 --> 00:11:47,240
Next, with 23 stars.

209
00:11:48,920 --> 00:11:50,660
The Golden Dawn's Mimosa Vermillion.

210
00:11:51,500 --> 00:11:54,200
You're now a 2nd-class intermediate Magic Knight.

211
00:11:55,340 --> 00:12:01,700
During the battle at the Shadow Palace, you showed great humanity while effectively fulfilling your duty as a recovery mage.

212
00:12:01,700 --> 00:12:05,460
And we know that you'll save many more lives in the future.

213
00:12:07,140 --> 00:12:12,920
If you ask me, Mimosa's the reason why so many more people understand the importance of recovery magic these days.

214
00:12:13,400 --> 00:12:14,740
This is a great honor.

215
00:12:15,300 --> 00:12:18,480
I'll do my best to live up to it during our battle with the Spade Kingdom.

216
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:26,840
And with a total of 18 stars, Leopold Vermillion of the Crimson Lion Kings, you are now a 4th-class Senior Magic Knight.

217
00:12:27,660 --> 00:12:35,260
When the Captains were absent, you rallied your cohorts and did everything in your power to stop your Vice-Captain, who was possessed by an Elf.

218
00:12:35,260 --> 00:12:40,380
I hope the strength of your character will continue to lead us down the path to victory.

219
00:12:42,280 --> 00:12:45,980
It appears young Leopold is advanced by three ranks as well.

220
00:12:52,160 --> 00:12:53,960
I'm sorry, I can't accept!

221
00:12:57,800 --> 00:13:02,260
That night, if my brother hadn't shown up in time, we'd have all been annihilated!

222
00:13:02,260 --> 00:13:06,720
It's true, I did everything I could, but it still wasn't good enough.

223
00:13:07,380 --> 00:13:11,500
Everyone in my squad fought really hard to protect me, even at the risk of their own lives.

224
00:13:12,840 --> 00:13:15,960
Truth is, I'm only a weakling!

225
00:13:16,200 --> 00:13:17,980
I don't deserve this recognition!

226
00:13:20,660 --> 00:13:21,660
You're a fool!

227
00:13:22,940 --> 00:13:26,340
Have you no idea why they all put their lives on the line for your sake?

228
00:13:26,980 --> 00:13:28,820
They were moved by your courage!

229
00:13:29,240 --> 00:13:31,880
Your very existence inspired them to move forward!

230
00:13:32,260 --> 00:13:35,980
They knew the future of our squad would be safe in your hands!

231
00:13:36,600 --> 00:13:37,860
So accept the award!

232
00:13:38,220 --> 00:13:41,760
It represents the tireless hope and resolve of the Crimson Lion King!

233
00:13:42,580 --> 00:13:43,640
Hope and resolve?

234
00:13:52,260 --> 00:13:53,900
Please forgive my hesitation!

235
00:13:53,900 --> 00:14:00,580
I, Leopold Vermillion, will protect my squad and the kingdom from any foe, and become a mighty warrior who can lead the charge to victory!

236
00:14:00,580 --> 00:14:13,060
And now you know, from the Golden Dawn, sir.

237
00:14:14,640 --> 00:14:17,140
You've earned 77 stars total.

238
00:14:18,920 --> 00:14:19,440
Amazing!

239
00:14:19,440 --> 00:14:25,700
During the Star Festival for this year, did he just earn more than my whole squad?

240
00:14:25,700 --> 00:14:28,040
You're being promoted as well, you know.

241
00:14:28,880 --> 00:14:30,880
It's a first-class senior magic knight.

242
00:14:32,260 --> 00:14:32,620
Huh?

243
00:14:33,420 --> 00:14:34,540
This brat!

244
00:14:34,800 --> 00:14:35,120
What?

245
00:14:35,800 --> 00:14:39,040
You would award a title like that to a mere commoner?

246
00:14:39,040 --> 00:14:44,400
You dealt a fatal blow to the Devil who was the source of all that destruction.

247
00:14:45,120 --> 00:14:46,960
We're very proud of what you've achieved.

248
00:14:48,580 --> 00:14:49,060
Thanks.

249
00:14:49,060 --> 00:14:54,980
Now he's the same rank as Vice-Captain Longris!

250
00:14:55,500 --> 00:14:59,260
I can't believe Yuno's already made it one step below the squad captains!

251
00:15:00,160 --> 00:15:03,460
I don't really know what's going on, but it sounds pretty good!

252
00:15:03,640 --> 00:15:04,560
Great job, Yuno!

253
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:06,840
We should celebrate with a day!

254
00:15:07,080 --> 00:15:11,200
First-class senior magic knight.

255
00:15:12,040 --> 00:15:13,640
I'm that much closer.

256
00:15:14,780 --> 00:15:16,520
These four mages have to split...

257
00:15:16,520 --> 00:15:17,000
Hold on!

258
00:15:17,120 --> 00:15:17,860
Just a minute!

259
00:15:19,060 --> 00:15:23,140
Man, I get a headache every time that guy opens his mouth.

260
00:15:23,540 --> 00:15:24,780
Let's show some respect.

261
00:15:25,060 --> 00:15:26,200
Although I don't disagree.

262
00:15:26,520 --> 00:15:28,720
You do realize that's just as bad, right?

263
00:15:28,940 --> 00:15:33,480
You fools fail to recognize the person whose achievements in the last battle were second to none!

264
00:15:34,200 --> 00:15:37,480
The hero who guarded our kingdom's most precious treasure!

265
00:15:39,020 --> 00:15:39,500
Hmm?

266
00:15:40,060 --> 00:15:42,720
What about the great Seki-Brunsatsa?

267
00:15:42,720 --> 00:15:43,480
Uh-huh!

268
00:15:43,480 --> 00:15:53,140
Not only did you slugs have the audacity to leave your king unattended in a crisis, but certain parties were nasty enough to attack me as well!

269
00:15:53,140 --> 00:15:55,860
I kind of wish I would have run him through!

270
00:15:55,860 --> 00:15:56,860
Cool, shut up.

271
00:15:56,860 --> 00:16:00,080
The glory belongs to Seki, not to them!

272
00:16:00,080 --> 00:16:01,580
He's the real hero!

273
00:16:02,580 --> 00:16:09,800
During that awful confrontation, he bravely dodged the enemy's spells and rushed to my rescue on that strange vehicle of his!

274
00:16:09,800 --> 00:16:13,060
None of these other neophytes even attempted to help their king!

275
00:16:13,060 --> 00:16:15,780
They should be punished, not praised!

276
00:16:18,900 --> 00:16:21,700
Oh, honestly, I just kind of showed up.

277
00:16:22,240 --> 00:16:24,820
By my authority as ruler of this kingdom,

278
00:16:26,820 --> 00:16:31,120
I award to Seki the title of First Class Senior Magic Knight!

279
00:16:32,840 --> 00:16:36,100
Did he say First Class Senior Magic Knight?

280
00:16:36,520 --> 00:16:38,180
That's like the cream of the crop!

281
00:16:38,180 --> 00:16:44,420
If that riff-raff is worthy of such prestige, then there's no reason I can't promote Seki to the same level!

282
00:16:47,020 --> 00:16:47,660
Uh-oh.

283
00:16:48,680 --> 00:16:50,260
Oh my god!

284
00:16:50,760 --> 00:16:52,680
I've never felt this hated in my life!

285
00:16:52,760 --> 00:16:53,900
They're gonna have my head!

286
00:16:55,580 --> 00:16:56,020
Right.

287
00:16:56,220 --> 00:16:58,540
It's a privilege to accept such an honor, your majesty.

288
00:16:58,800 --> 00:17:00,520
I give you my word, I will fight!

289
00:17:00,920 --> 00:17:02,080
And, uh, win!

290
00:17:02,280 --> 00:17:03,060
No matter what!

291
00:17:03,300 --> 00:17:04,400
No matter what!

292
00:17:04,480 --> 00:17:07,780
I will always take great pride in protecting the Clover Kingdom with my very life,

293
00:17:07,780 --> 00:17:08,740
and that's a promise!

294
00:17:09,460 --> 00:17:11,660
So please don't kill me, okay?

295
00:17:14,380 --> 00:17:16,660
Well then, will that be all, sir?

296
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:17,700
Yes!

297
00:17:18,040 --> 00:17:22,200
I hope the rest of you will follow his example and always make me your utmost priority!

298
00:17:23,320 --> 00:17:23,720
Forever!

299
00:17:25,500 --> 00:17:26,020
Whew!

300
00:17:26,160 --> 00:17:27,380
That was a close call!

301
00:17:27,380 --> 00:17:40,580
Now, as I was saying, those five knights aside, everyone else who fought against the Eye of the Midnight Sun will be promoted by one rank.

302
00:17:40,580 --> 00:17:46,400
I see. That must be why they asked all the captains to attend.

303
00:17:46,860 --> 00:17:50,960
I knew that old blowhard being here wasn't a good enough reason to require us to come.

304
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:55,760
The Wizard King cares so deeply for our squads. I'm grateful.

305
00:17:55,760 --> 00:17:59,620
All of the magic knights who risked their lives will be rewarded.

306
00:18:00,440 --> 00:18:06,020
If not for the magic parliament trial causing all that chaos, there might have been many more promotions.

307
00:18:08,860 --> 00:18:14,360
And although we cannot award them at this time, we've decided to give credit where we can.

308
00:18:15,360 --> 00:18:17,400
Black Bull's Captain Yami Sukuhiro.

309
00:18:17,640 --> 00:18:19,340
Really? I got something?

310
00:18:19,340 --> 00:18:26,440
Please continue to exercise great leadership and help keep the Clover Kingdom peaceful.

311
00:18:29,640 --> 00:18:33,120
I was kind of hoping for money, but thanks.

312
00:18:34,800 --> 00:18:37,660
This concludes the special decoration ceremony.

313
00:18:38,860 --> 00:18:42,420
In closing, I would like to read you a message from the Wizard King himself.

314
00:18:44,620 --> 00:18:47,880
Although we have begun to recover from the previous conflict,

315
00:18:47,880 --> 00:18:51,460
the threat of the Spade Kingdom looms ever nearer.

316
00:18:52,320 --> 00:18:55,640
I expect nothing but the best from the knights who were promoted today.

317
00:18:57,460 --> 00:18:59,700
To those who did not receive titles,

318
00:19:00,220 --> 00:19:02,480
I trust that you will continue to train hard,

319
00:19:02,960 --> 00:19:04,440
work together as magic knights,

320
00:19:04,680 --> 00:19:07,920
and protect our beloved kingdom and all who reside here.

321
00:19:08,860 --> 00:19:09,800
Yes, sir!

322
00:19:11,960 --> 00:19:13,180
We're home!

323
00:19:13,180 --> 00:19:13,580
We're home!

324
00:19:17,880 --> 00:19:22,320
You're never gonna catch me!

325
00:19:22,820 --> 00:19:23,660
Shut up!

326
00:19:23,760 --> 00:19:25,420
Quit moving around, you little punk!

327
00:19:26,580 --> 00:19:29,880
You think the enemy's just gonna stand still and wait for you to hit him?

328
00:19:30,580 --> 00:19:32,720
Oh, hey, it's Fineral and Captain Yami.

329
00:19:32,860 --> 00:19:34,000
Welcome back, you guys.

330
00:19:35,200 --> 00:19:37,040
Can't you runce train outside?

331
00:19:37,320 --> 00:19:38,640
It's too damn loud.

332
00:19:39,300 --> 00:19:39,960
Hey, look!

333
00:19:40,840 --> 00:19:41,500
Uh-huh.

334
00:19:41,740 --> 00:19:42,860
Now I got you.

335
00:19:42,860 --> 00:19:44,880
We're gonna send you to the Heart Kingdom.

336
00:19:45,600 --> 00:19:46,000
Really?

337
00:19:47,540 --> 00:19:48,980
Does that mean it's official?

338
00:19:49,920 --> 00:19:51,880
You and Nero, too, of course.

339
00:19:52,260 --> 00:19:54,100
Plus, Noelle and my wheels here.

340
00:19:54,340 --> 00:19:55,580
You're coming, too, Fineral?

341
00:19:55,740 --> 00:19:57,160
It sure seems that way.

342
00:19:57,920 --> 00:20:00,700
I can't wait till I kick some enemy butt!

343
00:20:01,220 --> 00:20:01,680
Yep.

344
00:20:02,080 --> 00:20:03,300
Go nuts, little fella.

345
00:20:04,500 --> 00:20:04,980
Please.

346
00:20:05,240 --> 00:20:05,400
Hm?

347
00:20:06,240 --> 00:20:08,020
You have to let me go, too.

348
00:20:08,020 --> 00:20:12,240
If he goes, I can't just sit here on my ass.

349
00:20:13,020 --> 00:20:15,920
I promise I'll become even stronger than he is.

350
00:20:17,080 --> 00:20:19,660
It was already decided in the Captain's meeting.

351
00:20:19,860 --> 00:20:20,640
Sorry, Magna.

352
00:20:23,620 --> 00:20:24,600
Please, boss.

353
00:20:24,920 --> 00:20:26,380
I'm begging you here.

354
00:20:27,120 --> 00:20:28,680
He's always a step ahead of me.

355
00:20:29,460 --> 00:20:34,820
But if I'm going to be a real man, then I refuse to be left behind anymore.

356
00:20:35,340 --> 00:20:37,620
I'll go even if you tell me to stay here.

357
00:20:38,980 --> 00:20:42,500
With mana like yours, you're likely to get yourself killed.

358
00:20:44,420 --> 00:20:45,740
You good with that?

359
00:20:46,540 --> 00:20:47,040
Yes, sir.

360
00:20:47,780 --> 00:20:50,300
I can push past the limits of my mana.

361
00:20:50,820 --> 00:20:52,880
More than any commoner has before.

362
00:20:53,920 --> 00:20:54,580
All right.

363
00:20:55,280 --> 00:20:57,920
I'll ask Julius if there's room for another guy.

364
00:20:59,360 --> 00:21:01,400
But just remember one thing.

365
00:21:01,880 --> 00:21:04,480
It doesn't make a damn bit of difference where you train.

366
00:21:04,880 --> 00:21:06,200
It's how that's important.

367
00:21:06,760 --> 00:21:07,440
You understand?

368
00:21:08,220 --> 00:21:08,840
Got it.

369
00:21:09,320 --> 00:21:10,140
This is great.

370
00:21:10,220 --> 00:21:12,100
I'm so happy you're coming with us.

371
00:21:12,260 --> 00:21:14,800
It's real fun if I get too far ahead of you.

372
00:21:15,020 --> 00:21:16,000
Yeah, watch out.

373
00:21:16,360 --> 00:21:18,020
I'll catch up before you know it.

374
00:21:18,280 --> 00:21:19,480
Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha!

375
00:21:19,480 --> 00:21:20,160
Sweet.

376
00:21:20,160 --> 00:21:23,860
We got Finral, Magnus going, and luck.

377
00:21:24,300 --> 00:21:27,560
Now let's head over to Heart and give it all we got!

378
00:21:28,200 --> 00:21:28,680
Yeah!

379
00:21:28,680 --> 00:21:38,500
Look at you, Karmy, to the top of the ladder in one step.

380
00:21:38,640 --> 00:21:40,420
You really are the coolest guy ever!

381
00:21:40,420 --> 00:21:43,580
I know you'll become the Wizard King soon.

382
00:21:43,700 --> 00:21:45,120
Maybe sooner than we thought.

383
00:21:45,800 --> 00:21:46,880
Don't be dumb.

384
00:21:47,260 --> 00:21:48,820
It's not like it'll be that easy.

385
00:21:49,900 --> 00:21:52,000
But yeah, someday.

386
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:57,200
It's only a matter of time.

387
00:21:57,200 --> 00:21:58,200
I know you'll be that easy.

388
00:21:58,200 --> 00:21:58,760
I know you'll be that easy.

389
00:21:58,760 --> 00:21:59,760
I know you'll be that easy.

390
00:21:59,760 --> 00:22:29,740
I know you'll be that easy.

391
00:22:29,760 --> 00:22:33,180
Like I can't inject gel подобного time.

392
00:22:33,760 --> 00:22:38,020
Because I'd know you're coming with west.

393
00:22:48,040 --> 00:22:54,540
I know you won't embarrass me yet.

394
00:22:54,540 --> 00:22:58,380
You're so happy that I will guide you on the back.

395
00:22:58,380 --> 00:23:21,660
Theéééééé Thoughts

396
00:23:28,380 --> 00:23:40,280
I'll keep following my own path, and one day, I'll be the Wizard King.

397
00:23:41,080 --> 00:23:45,040
Black Clover, page 154. Vice-Captain Longris Fod.

398
00:23:45,920 --> 00:23:49,040
Don't hold back when you challenge me. You'll get hurt.

